WEBVTT - Night of the Living Dead (English Subtitles)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[A lonely car drives winding through a desolate rural cemetery]

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Johnny: "I still don't know why we have to drive all the way out here."

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Barbra: "Because our mother asked us to, Johnny. It's only once a year."

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Johnny: "Look at this place. It's completely deserted. The radio is all static."

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
[Ominous wind rustles the dry autumn trees]

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Johnny: "They're coming to get you, Barbra!"

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Barbra: "Stop it, Johnny! You're acting like a child."

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:15.000
A strange figure stumbles slowly between the gravestones...
